      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the doctor and all but im literally just in my living room right now and i dont have time for an appointment lol. plus the drops are specifically for eyes, so wouldnt that be better than just doing nothing? i really feel like if i use them now it'll just stop any bacteria from the cleaner from growing. can u just tell me if it's actually dangerous to use them or am i totally overthinking this?",
